    "updated_at": "2020-08-07T14:56:15Z",
    "body": "> But we don't use the `optional` keyword for that---because it's redundant with the default value.\r\n\r\nCurrently we do use `optional` keyword for every optional argument, and specifying a default value without `optional` is a syntax error.\r\n\r\n```\r\nArgumentRest ::\r\n    optional TypeWithExtendedAttributes ArgumentName Default\r\n    Type Ellipsis ArgumentName\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
