    "body": "Ah, sorry, I was confused by your example and thought it was currently Web IDL.\r\n\r\nWell, the larger point still stands. I think it will be nice to align both types of optional argument to use `argName = default value`, instead of one using `optional argName = defaultValue` and the other using `optional argName`.",
